config SPACEMIT_K3_DDR
	bool "SpacemiT K3 (X100) DDR controller and PHY init"
	depends on TARGET_SPACEMIT_K3
	default y if TARGET_SPACEMIT_K3
	help
	  Enable the SpacemiT K3 (X100) DDR driver. It runs in the SPL/XPL
	  phase: it brings up the Synopsys DDR controller and PHY, runs DDR
	  training (LPDDR4X / LPDDR5) and supports the quick-boot path that
	  restores a previously saved training result. The large opaque
	  register/timing tables are carried verbatim from the vendor BSP.
